# E-G1 cell file. One JSON object per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# A JSON array of the same objects is also accepted.
# tag: string (image, ui, code, tests, docs, math, or any other tag)
# agent: profile name, the name `av agent set` prints
# trials: integer, sessions in the cell
# accepted: integer, sessions the hidden tests accepted (not greater than trials)
# tokens_per_accepted: integer, or null when accepted is 0 (a number is then ignored)
# A cell with trials < 10 is inconclusive. A tie for best is inconclusive.
# An agent with any inconclusive cell gets no `av agent set` line.
{"tag":"image","agent":"grok","trials":20,"accepted":18,"tokens_per_accepted":1000}
